NOT IMPLEMENTED: effect handlers (`with EffectName body op (args) (resume) = ...`) are parsed and lowered to IRHandle, but X86_64CodeGen.cs has no case for IRHandle — falls through to EmitUnhandled which returns 0. A proper implementation needs continuation machinery (stack snapshot + resume). Covered in docs/Active/Compiler/REF-LESSONS-FOR-SELFHOST.md and this is where to start.
